<section id="ez-faq" data-pricing-faq>
  <div class="ez-faq-shell">
    <h2>FAQs</h2>
    <div class="ez-faq-list">
      <article class="ez-faq-item">
        <button type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="pricing-faq-1" data-faq-button>
          <span>How does Easify pricing work?</span><span data-faq-sign aria-hidden="true">−</span>
        </button>
        <div id="pricing-faq-1" data-faq-panel><p>
  <strong>You pay based on your Monthly Box Revenue (MBR)</strong>: revenue from Easify boxes only, counted within your Shopify billing cycle.
</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Free until your box revenue reaches $500/month</strong></li>
  <li>$29/mo for box revenue from $500 to under $5,000</li>
  <li>$99/mo for box revenue from $5,000 to under $25,000</li>
  <li>$199/mo for box revenue above $25,000/mo, unlimited</li>
</ul>

<p>
  <strong>Flat fee. No percentage cuts. No surprises.</strong>
</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ez-faq-item">
        <button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pricing-faq-2" data-faq-button>
          <span>Is the free plan a trial, or actually free?</span><span data-faq-sign aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div id="pricing-faq-2" data-faq-panel hidden><p>Actually free until your box revenue reaches $500/month - refresh every billing cycle. Every feature is included from day one: all box types and templates, AI bundle builder assistant, the visual editor, discounts, upsells, and 24/7 live chat support.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ez-faq-item">
        <button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pricing-faq-3" data-faq-button>
          <span>What counts toward my plan tier?</span><span data-faq-sign aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div id="pricing-faq-3" data-faq-panel hidden><p>Only orders placed through Easify Box Builder count - after 14-day free trial, not your total Shopify store revenue. If your store makes $200,000 per month but boxes bring in under $500/month, you stay on the free plan. </p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ez-faq-item">
        <button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pricing-faq-4" data-faq-button>
          <span>Do you take a commission on my sales?</span><span data-faq-sign aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div id="pricing-faq-4" data-faq-panel hidden><p>No. Easify charges a flat monthly fee only, nothing extra.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ez-faq-item">
        <button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pricing-faq-5" data-faq-button>
          <span>What happens when my box revenue crosses a tier?</span><span data-faq-sign aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div id="pricing-faq-5" data-faq-panel hidden><p>Shopify charges only the difference, so your total matches the correct tier for that cycle. You are never charged twice.

Example: you are on Grow ($29) and your boxes reach $20,000 in the cycle. That is the Scale tier ($99), so Shopify adds $70. Your total for the cycle is $99.

Monthly Box Revenue resets to $0 at the start of each billing cycle.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ez-faq-item">
        <button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pricing-faq-6" data-faq-button>
          <span>Can I downgrade if my revenue drops?</span><span data-faq-sign aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div id="pricing-faq-6" data-faq-panel hidden><p>On Start/Free plan, your fee follows your box revenue in each cycle. When revenue goes down, your fee goes down with it, with no action needed.

And yes if you chose a paid plan as your base plan, you can select a lower plan on the Pricing page. The change applies from the next billing cycle.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ez-faq-item">
        <button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pricing-faq-7" data-faq-button>
          <span>What's included in the 14-day free trial on paid plans?</span><span data-faq-sign aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div id="pricing-faq-7" data-faq-panel hidden><p>Full access to every feature on every plan, including Start (Free). You can publish boxes and get real sales. Trial sales do not count toward billing. The trial is one-time per live store.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ez-faq-item">
        <button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pricing-faq-8" data-faq-button>
          <span>How does the 30-day money-back guarantee work?</span><span data-faq-sign aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div id="pricing-faq-8" data-faq-panel hidden><p>If you are not happy for any reason within 30 days of your first charge, contact us and we will refund you in full.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ez-faq-item">
        <button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pricing-faq-9" data-faq-button>
          <span>Is billing handled through Shopify?</span><span data-faq-sign aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div id="pricing-faq-9" data-faq-panel hidden><p>Yes. All charges appear directly in your Shopify admin. No separate account or credit card is needed.</p></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
